 "floorplan_note": "KV-AHUBDW 10-18: static hub cluster, 734.4 x 561.6 (die frame was the legacy hub 1175.04 x 760.32: -54% area).  Faces from the planned m1 KV die: ASTK WS/WN on W, ES/EN on E (ap/am), pvfin W (fr), kvs_attn + seq N (hs, hf), clock trunk + reset N.  Rows: Z trees zh0/zh1 MX at y 43.2 and zh2/zh3 R0 at y 345.6 with their S (input, 268 b) faces toward the 151.2-um logic band y 194.4-345.6 (core calendar / Z-load / LMAX / reciprocal issue, io leaf, ap pin flops) that spans W->E between the stack faces; reciprocal leaf R0 at 475.2,302.4 (inputs N, outputs S into the band, RX/RY relays 1).  64.8-um channels between tiles carry the zh root returns.  One clock entry ck (N centre) -> balanced spine to the 5 child clock pins (child-insertion leaf targets) + the band flops.",
 "structural_change": "NEW kit (KV-AHUBDW 10-18): the KV die hub element qkd_ahub_static_dw (static six-root hub) as a cluster of 5 CLOSED children (4 ot_nhb_zh m5 views, ot_qkh_recip_leaf np1 view) + flat core / io logic; the closed qkd_ahub_core belongs to the legacy hub and is not used.  RTL pin rules in 02f980add (flop-first pins, ot_rst_pipe regional resets).",
 "cycle_cost": "+1 edge on the stack inputs ap_s (pin flops; AP_OFS_s += 1 in kv_static_die.ahub_ages); hs / outputs unchanged; reset release +4 edges",
